From 8f38f09571dc289eb733ce28a08c119ecc211e90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 10:11:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(pwa): add offline support, service worker caching,
 and install button

- sw.js: three-tier caching (Cache-First for hashed assets, Network-First for navigation, SWR for public assets), excludes API/WS/Socket.IO paths
- offline.html: bilingual offline fallback page with dark mode support
- PwaInstallButton.vue: beforeinstallprompt install button with tooltip
- usePwa.ts: SW registration, update detection (30min periodic check), skip-waiting
- manifest.webmanifest: enhanced with orientation, display_override, launch_handler, dark theme color, 192+512 icons
- index.html: dark/light theme-color media queries, mobile-web-app-capable, black-translucent status bar
- Updated pwa-metadata test assertions for new manifest structure
